		(at 26.65 42.85)
		(descr "Vybronics VG1040003D coin LRA, held by ring_top in a cup over the board's front: no copper (the pogo pins are its contacts) and no silk. The coin (10 mm) and its tab toward the two contact pads (2.0 mm square at 2.7 mm pitch, 7.45 mm from the coin's centre) are drawn on the user drawing layer. The courtyard is the cup's keep-clear, nothing but the pins inside r 6.7 of the coin's centre (mechanical.toml [haptics_front] no_parts_radius), less a notch over the tab for the pins: 2.8 either side of the tab's axis (the tab land's 2.7 and 0.1), from 0.3 short of the pads. A footprint that draws no silk or fab claims its courtyard as the part. Origin at the pads' midpoint, the coin north")
